    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n132 Wyckham Point is a bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 78.4 sq. m. / 844 sq. ft., ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development in the heart of Dundrum. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property benefits from a desirable west-facing balcony, allowing natural light to flood the living accommodation and creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises a large and welcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring, recessed lighting, a hot press and a spacious utility room providing excellent additional storage. The generous open-plan living/dining room is bright and airy, featuring floor-to-ceiling windows, recessed lighting and direct access to a private west-facing balcony, ideal for enjoying afternoon and evening sun. The adjoining kitchen is fitted with a range of integrated appliances and offers excellent storage and workspace.\n\nThere are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from fitted wardrobes, with the principal bedroom further enhanced by a fully tiled en-suite shower room. A spacious fully tiled main bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nWyckham Point is a highly regarded development built by O'Malley Construction and Dorville Homes, surrounded by beautifully maintained landscaped communal grounds. Residents benefit from a 24-hour concierge service, secure underground parking and excellent on-site amenities including a private gym, sauna and steam room facilities.\n\nIdeally located off the Wyckham Bypass, the development is within walking distance of Dundrum Town Centre, Airfield Estate and a host of local shops, cafés and restaurants. Excellent transport links are available with the Luas at Balally nearby, numerous Dublin Bus routes serving the area and easy access to the M50.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a superb apartment in one of South Dublin's most convenient and desirable residential locations, offering an ideal balance of style, comfort and convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.37m x 4.17m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring, radiator, recessed lighting, hot press and large utility/storage room.\n\nUtility Room - 1.64m x 0.96m\nSpacious utility room providing additional storage and laundry space.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.09m x 8.80m\nBright and spacious open-plan living/dining room with laminate flooring, recessed lighting, radiator and boiler press. Floor-to-ceiling windows provide excellent natural light and direct access to the balcony.\n\nBalcony - 3.39m x 1.19m\nPrivate west-facing balcony with tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen - \nTiled flooring and tiled splashback. Fitted with an Elica extractor hood, Zanussi hob, Candy integrated microwave, Neff oven, Electrolux integrated dishwasher and Zanussi integrated fridge freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.52m x 3.71m\nSpacious double bedroom with laminate flooring, radiator, fitted wardrobes and en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.61m x 2.19m\nFully tiled en-suite comprising walk-in shower with sliding door, wash hand basin, w.c., mirrored vanity unit and heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.76m x 3.13m\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring, radiator, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting and views over the communal gardens.\n\nBathroom - 2.15m x 2.11m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath with shower attachment, wash hand basin, mirrored vanity unit, w.c., heated towel rail and shelving.\n\n"
      },
      {
